{"articleNo":"2889","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2889&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-2학기 대학원별 재입학 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.07.11","hit":"10107","attachments":[{"name":"2011학년도 후기 대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육) 재입학 제출 서류.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2889&attachNo=1557"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011학년도 후기 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육) 재입학 공고</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"></span></p><hr><br><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 재입학 대상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;대학원, 산업대학원 및 교육대학원 석사과정에 재학중 자퇴, 미등록․미복학 등으로 제적된 자중 재입학을 희망하는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 재입학 신청 일정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 재입학원서 접수기간 : 2011. 7. 13(수) ～ 7. 15(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 재입학 신청 장소 : 각 학과(전공) 행정사무실 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 대학원지원팀 제출 : 2011. 7. 19(화)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 재입학 허가일 : 2011. 8. 10(수)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 라. 수강신청일 : 2011. 8. 16(화) ～ 8. 19(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 마. 등록기간 : 2011. 8. 23(화) ～ 8. 26(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 재입학 제출서류</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 재입학 원서 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 각서 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 지도교수 추천서 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 라. 학적부 및 성적증명서 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 기타사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 재입학자가 기 취득한 학점 및 성적은 그대로 인정한다.</span>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">재입학이 허가된 자는 소정의 기일 내에 입학금 및 기타 납입금의<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;납부 등 학적제반 절차를 이행하여야 한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2011.&nbsp;&nbsp; 7.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; .</span></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><br></p>\n</span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교총장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
